Please note that it's not always possible or useful to assert the entirety of the array in this case because the asserted value (`New_Ret`) depends on the specific value being added (`x`) and the specific index at which it's being added (`index`), which could be anything, especially if this method is being parameterized by Pex. Instead, it's usually more useful to assert specific conditions on the array list that depend on the inputs and expected behavior of the method under test.
